0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 647.00 Td (**xv6-riscv** is a modern, pedagogical re-implementation of Dennis Ritchie's and Ken) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 634.50 Td (Thompson's Unix Sixth Edition \(V6\) operating system, developed at MIT by Frans Kaashoek, Robert) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 622.00 Td (Morris, and Russ Cox. Written in clean, ANSI C for the 64-bit RISC-V architecture \(`rv64gc`\),) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 609.50 Td (xv6 implements all core Unix mechanisms:) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 593.00 Td (* Monolithic kernel architecture with strict hardware privilege separation \(RISC-V Machine,) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 580.50 Td (Supervisor, and User modes\).) Tj ET
