0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 395.33 248.50 Td (Designed for long-running batch an) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (The scheduling invariant is strict:) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 211.50 Td (**The scheduler will never run a process in Q1 if there is a RUNNABLE process in Q0. It will) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 199.00 Td (never run a process in Q2 if Q0 or Q1 has a RUNNABLE process, and so on.**) Tj ET
