0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 152.50 Td (To minimize context-switching overhead on long-running batch tasks while keeping interactive) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 140.00 Td (tasks snappy, the time quantum increases exponentially as priority decreases:) Tj ET
