0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 731.00 Td (High-priority queues have small time slices so interactive processes can interleave rapidly.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 718.50 Td (Low-priority queues have large time slices so CPU-bound processes can run for extended periods) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 706.00 Td (without context-switch churn.) Tj ET
0.15 0.30 0.50 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 50.00 678.50 Td (3.6 Quantum Consumption and Process Demotion) Tj ET
