0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 452.50 Td (5. **Rule 5:** After every $N$ ticks \(`BOOST_INTERVAL`\), all processes in the system are) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 440.00 Td (boosted back to Q0.) Tj ET
