0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 611.50 Td (`stvec`\), or directly access kernel memory pages.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 595.00 Td (* **Supervisor Mode \(S-Mode\):** The operating system kernel runs in supervisor mode. It has) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 582.50 Td (full authority to configure page tables, handle hardware interrupts, execute privileged) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 570.00 Td (instructions \(`sret`, `wfi`\), and control peripheral devices.) Tj ET
