0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 380.00 Td (1. Hardware timer expires: RISC-V hardware sets supervisor timer interrupt flag in `sip`.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 363.50 Td (2. Hardware switches to S-mode, saves `pc` to `sepc`, and jumps to the address in `stvec`.) Tj ET
