0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 289.00 Td (5. In `usertrap\(\)`, `devintr\(\)` identifies the interrupt source. If it is a timer interrupt) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 276.50 Td (\(`scause == 0x8000000000000005L`\), `clockintr\(\)` is called, incrementing global `ticks` and) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (waking up sleeping timer channels.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 247.50 Td (6. Under MLFQ, `usertrap\(\)` calls `mlfq_tick\(\)`, which updates tick counts and determines) Tj ET
