0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 647.00 Td (**xv6 Shell**.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 630.50 Td (2. The shell creates a process \(`fork`\), which traps into the kernel \(`exec`\) to load the ELF) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 618.00 Td (binary from disk into RAM.) Tj ET
