0.10 0.12 0.20 rg BT /F3 7.5 Tf 58.00 511.50 Td () Tj ET
0.10 0.12 0.20 rg BT /F3 7.5 Tf 58.00 501.00 Td (In xv6, `copyout\(p->pagetable, p->sz, dstva, src, len\)` safely resolves this:) Tj ET
0.10 0.12 0.20 rg BT /F3 7.5 Tf 58.00 490.50 Td (- It translates user virtual address `dstva` using the process's page table.) Tj ET
0.10 0.12 0.20 rg BT /F3 7.5 Tf 58.00 480.00 Td (- It verifies that the user page table entry has the `PTE_U` \(User\) flag and `PTE_W` \(Writable\) flag set.) Tj ET
