0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 362.00 Td (handling, timer interrupt delivery, privilege level switching, and register preservation in) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 349.50 Td (`trampoline.S`.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 333.00 Td (* **Concurrency & Synchronization:** Mastered xv6 spinlock discipline, learning to avoid lock) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 320.50 Td (inversion deadlocks and prevent race conditions between scheduler threads and interrupt) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 308.00 Td (handlers.) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 291.50 Td (* **Memory Safety:** Learned the critical necessity of virtual memory translation and) Tj ET
0.15 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 50.00 279.00 Td (user-pointer validation via `copyout\(\)`.) Tj ET
0.15 0.30 0.50 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 50.00 251.50 Td (11.3 Demonstration Guide for College Viva) Tj ET
